              "text": "anstatt — \"instead of\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Anstatt zu lernen, hat er den ganzen Abend gespielt. Instead of studying, he played all evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With zu + infinitive, as here, or with the genitive: anstatt eines Briefes. Also anstatt dass …, with the verb at the end."
            }
          ]
        },
